WEBVTT

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:02.071
My mom has managed
to maintain her glamour,

00:04:02.071 --> 00:04:03.739
her sex appeal,

00:04:03.739 --> 00:04:06.117
you know, her independence.

00:04:06.617 --> 00:04:08.786
And I really hope
some of that rubs off on me.

00:04:09.745 --> 00:04:14.000
You know, recently I’ve been
thinking about one of the best lessons

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.751
that my mom ever taught me,

00:04:15.751 --> 00:04:18.129
which is the literal beauty in aging.

00:04:18.879 --> 00:04:21.132
Now, we all know
that Black don’t crack, right?

00:04:22.633 --> 00:04:23.634
OK...

00:04:24.135 --> 00:04:25.136
Black don’t crack.

00:04:25.553 --> 00:04:30.016
So at the age of 50, my mom could have
easily passed for the age of 35.